# JUnit Testing Exercises

## Exercise 1 - Setting Up JUnit

- Created a Maven Java project.
- Added JUnit 4.13.2 dependency.
- Created sample test class.

## Exercise 3 - Assertions

Implemented:

- assertEquals()
- assertTrue()
- assertFalse()
- assertNull()
- assertNotNull()

## Exercise 4 - AAA Pattern

Implemented:

- Arrange
- Act
- Assert
- @Before
- @After

Run the tests using:

mvn test